Package: kilix
Architecture: all
Depends: kilix-engine, kilix-native, kilix-tui-utils (>= 0.3.1+packaging2),
 python3, git, procps, util-linux,
 ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: kilix-multiplexer
Description: terminal desktop built on the Kilix engine
 Kilix turns a GPU terminal into a small desktop: tabs and panes that outlive
 the window, a settings panel, a file and application launcher, session
 persistence and helpers for coding agents.
 .
 This package carries the launcher, its configuration, the built-in desktop
 and the Python modules Kilix pins. It installs under /usr/share/kilix and
 adds the command kilix. The terminal engine and the compiled helpers come
 from kilix-engine and kilix-native. Per-user state stays under
 ~/.local/gpu_terminal.

Package: kilix-native
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: compiled helpers for the Kilix terminal desktop
 Kilix builds a few small C programs for each user the first time they are
 needed. This package carries them already built, so a machine that installs
 Kilix from packages needs no compiler:
 .
  * kitty-pty-broker, which owns the pseudo-terminals of Kilix panes so that
    they outlive the terminal window;
  * libkilix-state, the durable store for desktop settings;
  * the terminal screensavers.
 .
 Everything is installed under /usr/lib/kilix/native. Nothing is added to
 PATH or to the system library path.

Package: kilix-multiplexer
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: libkilix-encodec (>= 0.1.5),
 ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: remote terminal programs for the Kilix terminal desktop
 The two programs behind "kilix remote": kmx-serve shares a Kilix pane over
 an encrypted connection and kmx-attach connects to one, with predictive
 echo and optional EnCodec audio. Kilix otherwise compiles them per user.
 .
 Both are installed under /usr/lib/kilix/native. Nothing is added to PATH.
 .
 It links the audio codec library libkilix-encodec, which needs the patched
 ONNX Runtime 1.21 build from the same archive.
